    <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:ROLE-gray-aw" />
    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:ROLE-outer-encryption" />
    <tdn:basis>source_stated</tdn:basis>
    <tdn:qualification>Annotation of the source assignment; no universal or existential property restriction is asserted.</tdn:qualification>
    <tdn:qualification>The target can comprise multiple deployed components. Presence and management exclusions remain in the source requirements.</tdn:qualification>
    <tdn:rationale>The source assigns maintenance, monitoring, and security control of the named target to the Gray AW.</tdn:rationale>
    <tdn:sourceUnit rdf:resource="urn:tdn:csfc:source:CSFC-MSC-1.3.0-4e40e3d83708:p024:u010.s001" />
