  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" />
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology" />
    <rdfs:comment>A class describes entities matching an extracted role or realization concept. Classes may overlap and may have multiple parents. No device existence, class disjointness, or class equivalence is asserted. Non-subtype links are OWL annotation assertions between class IRIs. They preserve source context without imposing object-property restrictions or asserting a relationship for every class member.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:versionInfo>CSfC MSC 1.3.0; TDN role hierarchy 1.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <tdn:inputHash>roles/ontology_decisions.json sha256:67b6f5f4c370a07cb13fa7034414721a6662bcf99e3407feb592b3fc81c1b7fe</tdn:inputHash>
    <tdn:inputHash>roles/roles.json sha256:6a12f5298603f2cfd51af099a48ae761d561e25b60e7b753ab990cb76454d8e5</tdn:inputHash>
    <tdn:inputHash>source/source_index.jsonl sha256:39b9770a52900512a58e468a83839238d4583e030ac76870fd8f11e4aff2d5dc</tdn:inputHash>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:tdn:csfc:msc:roles:ExtractedRole">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" />
    <rdfs:comment>Analyst-defined organizational superclass for realizations of the role and concept categories extracted from the CSfC MSC v1.3.0 source. Each role class denotes the entities or bearers that realize its source-context category. The categories include devices, services, aggregates, mixed authorities, and protocol functions. The root does not reproduce a CP definition and does not assert that every category is a physical device or an MSC Solution Component. Classes without a curated parent receive a generated organizational edge to the root; that edge is separate from source-backed subtype evidence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>Extracted role or concept realization</rdfs:label>
    <tdn:roleId>ExtractedRole</tdn:roleId>
    <tdn:roleKind>analyst_organization</tdn:roleKind>
  </rdf:Description>
